  << /ActualText (Regulated online entertainment platform operating in Ukraine\054 Romania\054 and Croatia\054 with monthly active users approaching 1M\056 Owned the payments\054 authentication\054 KYC\054 and responsible gambling \050RG\051 domains\056\nDesigned and executed the modularization from 5 to 25\053 independently scoped modules\054 enabling per\055market builds on shared business logic\nOptimized Gradle build configuration using Convention Plugins and Gradle Properties\054 reducing build time by 33\045\nDesigned a common payment integration layer with shared interfaces and reusable UI components\054 reducing a new provider to a single contract implementation and cutting integration time by \17635\045\nBuilt 8\053 payment integrations from scratch\054 including Neteller\054 CorvusPay \050card and Revolut\051\054 IBAN via UPC\054 and crypto wallet deposits and withdrawals with QR support\nMigrated 30\053 screens from XML to Compose\054 keeping the app at 99\0567\045 crash\055free throughout\nRebuilt authentication and registration with OAuth 2\0560 social sign\055in\054 KYC identity verification\054 and market\055specific signup variants\nDecoupled rewritten features from the legacy monolith so they could be covered with unit and integration tests in CI\nImplemented feature flags and remote configuration for controlled rollouts across login\054 registration\054 and payment flows\054 enabling product behavior to be adjusted at runtime without a new release\nImplemented RG controls adapted to each market\047s regulatory requirements)
     /K [ 45 ]
     /P 3211 0 R
